(text "REGN divider limits default input current. A diode from INPUT_BOOST raises the hardware ceiling only after configuration.\nTS uses 5.23k pullup and 30.1k parallel return with external 103AT-2. Open/short NTC inhibits charging.\nNo ship FET: SDRV has the specified 1nF capacitor." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 61bd52ec-18b1-4cb7-9f29-b72e040263d8))
